---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1 class="hero-name">Blake Reichenbach</h1>
        <div class="hero-accent-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          I'm drawn to curiosity and intention. Whether it's software, essays, fiction,
          or a cabin in the Appalachian foothills — the common thread is a commitment to craft.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-photo-wrap">
        <img
          src="/images/blake.jpg"
          alt="Blake Reichenbach"
          class="hero-photo"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Gradient accent bar + diagonal wedge transition -->
  <div class="gradient-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="section-wedge" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <main>
    <!-- About -->
    <section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 id="about-heading">
          <span class="section-label">About</span>
          <span class="sr-only">Blake Reichenbach</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="about-body">
          <p>
            I'm a product manager by trade and a writer by compulsion, which means I spend a lot
            of time thinking about why things are built the way they are — and whether they could
            be better.
          </p>
          <p>
            As a PM, I've spent my career on ambitious, zero-to-one launches. The work I'm most
            proud of starts with genuine curiosity about what people actually need — not what they
            say they want, not what's easiest to build — and ends with something that earns their
            trust. I think of that as product taste: the ability to turn empathy into decisions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pull quote -->
        <blockquote class="pull-quote">
          "Product taste: the ability to turn empathy into decisions."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="about-body">
          <p>
            That same instinct shows up everywhere else. PRactical exists because I saw a gap in
            the market for a workout tracker that respects the user's intelligence — no bloat, no
            dark patterns, just a clean tool that does exactly what it promises. Non-Slop Fun
            exists because I believe the well-examined life is worth writing about, and that
            genuine creative and cultural commentary is an act of resistance against the default
            mode of mindless scrolling. The Berea Writers Cabin exists because a space should mean
            something — it should invite the kind of thinking that doesn't happen on a laptop screen.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm based in Kentucky. I'm a certified personal trainer who mostly just trains himself.
            I'm working on two novels — an Appalachian dark fantasy about ecology, class, and what
            it means to come home, and a high fantasy rooted in the mythology of gods and the people
            who live in their shadow. Both are works in progress, which feels like the right place
            for them to be.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you've landed here, you're probably curious, you make things, and you're a little
            skeptical of anything that was built to game your attention rather than earn it. Welcome.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects -->
    <section class="section projects" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 id="projects-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Projects</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="projects-grid">

          <!-- Non-Slop Fun -->
          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="card-media">
              <img
                src="/images/nonslop.png"
                alt="Non-Slop Fun — a collage illustration of a figure in a suit holding coffee"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-tag">Newsletter</span>
              <h3 class="card-title">Non-Slop Fun</h3>
              <p class="card-description">
                Reflection is resistance. Non-Slop Fun is a newsletter about creative and cultural
                commentary — examining the things worth examining, and celebrating the well-examined life.
              </p>
              <a
                href="https://www.nonslopfun.com"
                class="card-cta"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >Read it &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- PRactical Workouts -->
          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="card-media card-media--app">
              <img
                src="/images/practical.png"
                alt="PRactical Workouts app home screen showing weekly training stats and goals"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-tag">iOS App</span>
              <h3 class="card-title">PRactical Workouts</h3>
              <p class="card-description">
                A workout tracker for lifters who want a clean, intelligent tool without the bloat.
                No social features, no AI gimmicks — just straightforward progressive overload
                tracking done right.
              </p>
              <a
                href="https://www.practicalworkouts.com"
                class="card-cta"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >Download &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Creator's Hearth -->
          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="card-media">
              <img
                src="/images/creators-hearth.png"
                alt="Creator's Hearth — a watercolor fireplace logo"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-tag">Writing &amp; Craft</span>
              <h3 class="card-title">Creator's Hearth</h3>
              <p class="card-description">
                A niche site for writers who take the craft seriously. Practical guidance, honest
                takes, and a growing library of resources for fiction writers at every stage.
              </p>
              <a href="#" class="card-cta">Visit &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Berea Writers Cabin -->
          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="card-media card-media--photo">
              <img
                src="/images/cabin.jpg"
                alt="The Berea Writers Cabin — a rustic retreat with a waterwheel nestled in the Appalachian foothills"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-tag">Short-Term Rental · Berea, KY</span>
              <h3 class="card-title">Berea Writers Cabin</h3>
              <p class="card-description">
                A creative retreat in the Appalachian foothills, steeped in regional charm and
                designed for the kind of thinking that requires a change of scenery.
              </p>
              <span class="card-cta-disabled">Bookings Coming Soon</span>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Professional Work -->
    <section class="section work" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 id="work-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Product Work</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="work-intro">
          Selected work from my time as a Product Manager at HubSpot.
        </p>
        <div class="work-grid">

          <article class="work-card">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Trust &amp; Safety</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Fraud Detection &amp; ML Modernization</h3>
            <p class="work-description">
              Overhauled fraud detection in Trust &amp; Safety to leverage machine learning.
              Maintained accuracy and precision across key threat detection categories while laying
              the groundwork to shift from reactive to proactive modeling.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="work-card">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Policy &amp; Compliance</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Digital Services Act Compliance</h3>
            <p class="work-description">
              Designed HubSpot's product strategy for complying with the EU Digital Services Act —
              navigating the intersection of regulatory requirements, platform architecture, and
              user experience at scale.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="work-card">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Content Hub</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Content Remix</h3>
            <p class="work-description">
              Launched Content Remix as part of the creation of Content Hub, quickly establishing
              the tool as a flagship AI product within HubSpot's portfolio.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="work-card">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Search &amp; Discovery</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)</h3>
            <p class="work-description">
              Launched HubSpot's AEO v1 feature set, setting the stage for the acquisition of
              XFunnel and the re-release of the v2 tools currently on the market.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="work-card work-card--full">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Social</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Social Insights</h3>
            <p class="work-description">
              Conceptualized and launched HubSpot's Social Insights framework, built on Reddit
              data, to help brands extract meaningful audience and competitive insights from across
              the internet to inform their marketing strategies.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section class="section contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 id="contact-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Get in Touch</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="contact-intro">
          If something here resonated — or if you're thinking about working together — I'd love to
          hear from you. Whether it's a consulting engagement, a creative collaboration, or just a
          good conversation, feel free to reach out.
        </p>
        <form
          name="contact"
          method="POST"
          data-netlify="true"
          class="contact-form"
          aria-label="Contact form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="name" class="form-label">Name</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="name"
              name="name"
              required
              autocomplete="name"
              class="form-input"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email" class="form-label">Email</label>
            <input
              type="email"
              id="email"
              name="email"
              required
              autocomplete="email"
              class="form-input"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message" class="form-label">Message</label>
            <textarea
              id="message"
              name="message"
              required
              rows="6"
              class="form-input form-textarea"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="form-submit">Send &rarr;</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <span class="footer-copy">&copy; 2026 Blake Reichenbach</span>
      <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Project links">
        <a href="https://www.nonslopfun.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Non-Slop Fun</a>
        <a href="https://www.practicalworkouts.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PRactical Workouts</a>
        <a href="#">Creator's Hearth</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ── */
  .hero {
    background-color: var(--color-hero-bg);
    color: var(--color-hero-text);
    padding: 4rem 2rem 3.5rem;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 200px;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-hero-text);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .hero-accent-line {
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-terra);
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 18px);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-hero-muted);
    max-width: 460px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-photo-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-photo {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 25% 30%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(196, 120, 58, 0.4);
    display: block;
  }

  /* ── Gradient bar ── */
  .gradient-bar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c4783a, #8a6a3a, #4a6e3a);
  }

  /* ── Diagonal wedge transition ── */
  .section-wedge {
    height: 56px;
    background: var(--color-hero-bg);
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 0 100%);
  }

  /* ── Shared section layout ── */
  .section {
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── About ── */
  .about {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .pull-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 26px);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-terra);
    padding: 0.25rem 0 0.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    max-width: 620px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    quotes: none;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  /* ── Projects ── */
  .projects {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-card {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(42, 34, 24, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Card media area (image or decorative header) */
  .card-media {
    height: 190px;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .card-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    display: block;
  }

  /* App screenshot: show the top of the UI */
  .card-media--app img {
    object-position: top center;
  }

  /* Cabin photo: center vertically */
  .card-media--photo img {
    object-position: center center;
  }

  /* Decorative monogram headers */
  .card-media--terra {
    background-color: #f5e4d0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card-media--olive {
    background-color: #e4ede0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card-media-monogram {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 96px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .card-media--terra .card-media-monogram {
    color: var(--color-accent-terra);
    opacity: 0.22;
  }

  .card-media--olive .card-media-monogram {
    color: var(--color-accent-olive);
    opacity: 0.22;
  }

  /* Card text content */
  .card-content {
    padding: 20px 24px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .card-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-terra);
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .card-description {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .card-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent-terra);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: text-decoration 0.15s;
  }

  .card-cta:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .card-cta-disabled {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* ── Professional Work ── */
  .work {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .work-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .work-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .work-card {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    padding: 24px 24px 24px 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .work-card--full {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .work-employer {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
  }

  .work-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .work-description {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  /* ── Contact ── */
  .contact {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .contact-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .form-label {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
  }

  .form-input {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    width: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    outline: none;
  }

  .form-input:focus {
    border-color: var(--color-ink-light);
  }

  .form-textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 140px;
  }

  .form-submit {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background-color: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-hero-text);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .form-submit:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .form-submit:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent-terra);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* ── Footer ── */
  .footer {
    background-color: var(--color-hero-bg);
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-copy {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-hero-muted);
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-hero-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-hero-text);
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-photo {
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
    }

    .hero-photo-wrap {
      order: -1;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .pull-quote {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    /* Single-column grids on mobile */
    .projects-grid,
    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .work-card--full {
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
